urname>Fink</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name></person-group><year>1993</year><article-title>Elements of the yeast pheromone response pathway required for filamentous growth of diploids.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>262</volume><fpage>1741</fpage><lpage>1744</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8259520</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000322-Hartwell1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hartwell</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name></person-group><year>1967</year><article-title>Macromolecule synthesis in temperature-sensitive mutants of yeast.</article-title><source>J Bacteriol</source><volume>93</volume><fpage>1662</fpage><lpage>1670</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5337848</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000322-Brachmann1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brachmann</surname><given-names>CB</given-names></name><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Cost</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Caputo</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Designer deletion strains derived from <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic> S288C: a useful set of strains and plasmids for PCR-mediated gene disruption and other applications.</article-title><source>Yeast</source><volume>14(2)</volume><fpage>115</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9483801</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000322-Lambie1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lambie</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Roeder</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name></person-group><year>1988</year><article-title>A yeast centromere acts in c